ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197710/extras_big/81f819d27b38d4e604950002a478ff48.avif?t=1778766730 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonds between the women of the mansion pull together the story, from friendship to love, these strong emotions underpin the suspense which builds with each chapter.</p>",
